OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump meets Irish leaders
OL,4,Aas he begins two-day Ireland visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,7,Fin Dublin for the start of his two-day
OL,8,Fvisit to the Republic of Ireland -
OL,9,Fwatch live above
OL,11,FHe is greeted by the military band as
OL,12,Fhe meets with Taoiseach (Irish Prime
OL,13,FMinister) Micheal Martin at the
OL,14,FFarmleigh Estate
OL,16,FA little earlier, Trump met with Irish
OL,17,FPresident Catherine Connolly at her
OL,18,Fofficial residence in Phoenix Park
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
